OL,3,GNEWSAHomes plan will risk weekly
OL,4,Amarket, opponents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners say they are worried the
OL,7,Fredevelopment of a car park next to
OL,8,FBlackheath Station would mean the end
OL,9,Fof the area's popular farmers' market.
OL,11,FJohn Barron, of The Blackheath Society,
OL,12,Fa residents group opposing current
OL,13,Fplans, said it would be "detrimental"
OL,14,Fto traders and the community.
OL,16,F"We're not objecting to the development
OL,17,Fof the car park - it is this specific
OL,18,Fscheme -literally because we see it as
OL,19,Foverdevelopment and not taking into
OL,20,Faccount the issues that the local
OL,21,Fcommunity will experience," said
OL,22,FBarron.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
